      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 11,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "📱 Run your Capacitor app on a connected device or simulator.\nIf you omit the platform in an interactive terminal, the command asks whether to start on iOS or Android.\nThe command lists available devices and simulators, lets you reload the list, and runs with your selection.\nFor iOS, this asks whether to use a physical iPhone/iPad or simulator before showing devices.\nUse --no-launch to print the resolved command without starting the app."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 17,
